-- risk banding scale.
--
-- THE ENGINE FACT THIS TIER OWNS. Float is late start minus early start, and
-- an activity is critical when its float is zero. The retired engine computed
-- nothing and marked every activity critical.
--
-- THE TRAP THE TIER IS BUILT ON. The network duration and the calendar span
-- are different numbers, and an unscored risk is Unscored rather than Low.
-- ============================================================================

